## ''Chiefly used with {{lg|abstract noun}}s'': [[less#Determiner|less]] than all others in [[extent#Noun|extent]] or [[size#Noun|size]]; [[littlest]], [[smallest#Adjective|smallest]].
##: {{syn|en|slightest}}
